  "title": "Kalbi (Marinated Beef Short Ribs)",
  "description": "This variation of a traditional Korean recipe for marinated beef short ribs uses a marinade with soy sauce, sugar, sesame oil, and garlic.",
  "authors": [
    "LYZZARD"
  ],
